 "schemes.oauth2.description: \"Zendesk OAuth 2.0 access tokens. When an operation lists multiple\\nscopes, a token needs only one of the scopes to authorize the request.\\nThis behavior differs from the OpenAPI specification, in which all\\nscopes listed for a security scheme are required.\\n\"",
